# W6, host a (k5: its story has no key item 9, b's has): hosts stag0101 and goes into dng101b1 alone (the depart action
# with stag0101 matz00's target, dng101b1 point 0), before b arrives; once b is in a's instance in another stage group
# (stag0101), a takes its gate disc.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
depart dng101b1 0 until stage=dng101b1,control
log a in dng101b1
idle until epoch>=@260
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
log a home
